    "do you offer financing?": "Yes, we have several financing options for all credit needs and situations, and we work with all credit types - good credit, bad credit, or no credit history yet. REQUIRED: whenever financing comes up, END your reply by asking \"Would you like me to send you the pre-approval form?\" - always offer it, do not wait for them to ask. If they say yes, text them https://a2zautos.net/creditapp and tell them it's on the way; never read the URL out loud. We can also pre-qualify through Capital One, which does not affect their credit score.",
    "do you accept trade-ins? (feel free to be as detailed as you like)": "Yes, we take trade-ins and we also buy vehicles outright. A firm offer requires an in-person look at the vehicle.",
